// FLOOD RISK MAPPING
//
// This is ONLY an example.
// In the actual Mapathon, the problem may be:
//   - Flood risk
//   - Drought risk
//   - Landslide susceptibility
//   - Groundwater potential
//   - Agricultural suitability
//   - Hospital/site suitability
//   - Urban suitability
//   - Disaster vulnerability
//
// GENERAL WORKFLOW:
//
// DATA
//   ↓
// DERIVE FACTORS
//   ↓
// RECLASSIFY / STANDARDIZE
//   ↓
// ASSIGN WEIGHTS
//   ↓
// WEIGHTED OVERLAY
//   ↓
// RISK / SUITABILITY MAP
//   ↓
// AREA STATISTICS
//   ↓
// EXPORT
//
